.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ouch-list 1  "list " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
ouch\-list \- List contents of an archive
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBouch list\fR [\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-tree\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-no\fR] [\fB\-\-show\-size\fR] [\fB\-A\fR|\fB\-\-accessible\fR] [\fB\-\-depth\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-password\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-threads\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-sandbox\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIARCHIVES\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
List contents of an archive
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-tree\fR
Show archive contents as a tree
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip [Y/n] questions, default to yes
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-no\fR
Skip [Y/n] questions, default to no
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-size\fR
Show the (uncompressed) size of each file
.TP
\fB\-A\fR, \fB\-\-accessible\fR
Activate accessibility mode, reducing visual noise
.TP
\fB\-\-depth\fR \fI<DEPTH>\fR
Only list entries up to this recursion limit
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Silence output
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
Specify the format of the archive
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-password\fR \fI<PASSWORD>\fR
Decompress or list with password
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-threads\fR \fI<THREADS>\fR
Concurrent working threads
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-sandbox\fR
Disable the process sandbox
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIARCHIVES\fR>
Archives whose contents should be listed
